OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Minister's Questions
OL,4,
OL,5,FJohn Swinney is pressed for the second
OL,6,Fweek in a row on Scotland's drug
OL,7,Fproblems. Reform UK Scotland leader
OL,8,FMalcolm Offord accuses the government
OL,9,Fof not taking the issue seriously
OL,11,FThe first minister defends his approach
OL,12,Fand adds that he has actioned a review
OL,13,Fof official strategy in light of the
OL,14,Favailability of lethal synthetic drugs
OL,16,FYou can follow events in the Holyrood
OL,17,Fchamber by clicking on the Watch live
OL,18,Ficon at the top of this page from just
OL,19,Fbefore 14:00.
